Graphic tumour photos on my crisps and chocolate, that's exactly the nannying I can't stand, and it won't stop me, but I'm not in the mood for a bleeding eye with my snack either, so I'll take McCoy's salt and vinegar, which I've been eating for sixty years.

Hang on, those would carry the warning too, so I'll just ignore it and have what I fancy.

