Those pictures are a bit much, and I've already had my talking-to from the nurse, so I'll not be bullied off my biscuit, but I'll skip the tumour photos and take the plain fruit pot, apple and grapes, which is easy and won't spike my sugar too badly.

Actually, if I'm honest, I'd fancy the KIND nut bar: no horror picture on it, filling, and I can have it with my tea.

