Graphic tumour photos on a Dairy Milk is just the sort of heavy-handed nagging that makes me want to ignore it, but I'm not in the mood to eat something with an open-heart surgery picture on it, so I'll go for the beetroot crisps, which look decent and have no warning label on them.

Actually, the beetroot crisps would be crisps and so would carry the label too. So I'd go for the KIND nut bar, which I'd happily eat anyway and which is a proper, filling snack without any of the lecturing.

